---
source: crates/lastcall/tests/test_e2e_tui_snapshots.rs
expression: frame
---
"┌ keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ ↑ / k          previous entry / scroll up              u              restore the hunk           │"
"│ ↓ / j          next entry / scroll down                U              restore the whole file     │"
"│ PgUp / b       page up                                 z              undo the last accept       │"
"│ PgDn / Space   page down                               m              flag it with a note        │"
"│ ⏎ / l / →      open the diff                           M              clear the file's flags     │"
"│ Esc / h / ←    back to the file list (close help)      v              select lines               │"
"│ Tab            toggle focus                            y              copy selection             │"
"│ n / ]          next hunk                               i              edit in place              │"
"│ p / [          previous hunk                           I              $EDITOR at the hunk        │"
"│ e              expand a collapsed file                 d              ack the agent flag         │"
"│ f              full paths                              g              jump to the agent in herdr │"
"│ o              show org/repo                           w              workspace scope on/off     │"
"│ t              hide / show empty repos                 r              rescan now                 │"
"│ s              snooze this repo for a while            ?              this help                  │"
"│ S              show / hide snoozed repos               q / Ctrl-C     quit                       │"
"│ a              accept the hunk or the selected entry   y / ⏎          confirm                    │"
"│ A              accept the whole file                   n / Esc        cancel                     │"
"│ Ctrl-A         accept everything listed                                                          │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│ ^J is a newline in the note (⇧⏎ needs a kitty-protocol terminal)                                 │"
"│ shift+drag selects text (mouse capture is on) · v/y copies                                       │"
"│ lastcall tui --tour shows the welcome again                                                      │"
"│ any key closes                                                                                   │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
